Modifications (2026-10, LiZhongQC project): the upstream modules of the import closure of
ClassificationOfSurfaces.EvalStatement were concatenated, in dependency order, into the 28 bundle files;
each upstream file is kept as one block delimited by "BEGIN <upstream module> | <sha256>" with its
original copyright header; upstream import lines were removed and replaced by imports of the preceding
bundles. Local adaptations to Lean v4.35.0-rc2 and the project's Mathlib are proof repairs, plus
elaboration-only edits that change no statement type and no definition value:
  - four @[reducible] attributes: PartialTriangulation.toIntrinsic and PartialTriangulation.refine
    (bundle 17), ChartInductionGeometry.n and ChartInductionGeometry.subdivision (bundle 18);
  - `letI ... := inferInstance` in the bodies of ofOneFaceWordPreHomeomorph (bundle 22) and
    twoMonogonPreHomeomorph (bundle 23);
  - an explicit Decidable instance argument in def chartHalfDiamondMesh and in the private theorem
    restrictedRightDiamond_support (bundle 14).
No statement of the public endpoint classification_of_surfaces was changed. The edits are recorded per
bundle in the archive (prove/claude_r78_cls*, BUNDLE_MAP.json and the acceptance records of the Round78
registry).
Namespaces (LeanEval.Topology.ClassificationOfSurfaces, SurfaceCellComplex, ...) are unchanged.
